    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "You received an invitation to the renowned estate of Count Aegir. The eccentric inventor wishes to unveil his latest creation, claiming it to be his greatest one yet. Taking on the role of <strong>Loki</strong>, god of lies, you encounter a diverse cast of <strong>Germanic deities</strong> as you navigate the strange mansion. <br><br>Things soon get interesting, as the mansion itself rises from the ground and starts moving, subsequently <strong>trapping the visitors</strong> inside. Further complication arises, when the <strong>count is found unconscious</strong> and the mansion's <strong>control device</strong> is missing. Now it is up to Loki to find the culprit.<strong>Can the god of lies uncover the truth?</strong><br><br><strong>Meet Germanic deities</strong><br><br>On your quest to catch the assailant, you will have to interrogate and communicate with an array of Germanic gods and goddesses. Listen carefully to what they say, as even the innocent ones have plenty of secrets to discover. But be careful, or you might reveal things about yourself you rather had kept hidden.<br><br><br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785470/extras/8ac728cadbebe8e1dd388942c01f704c.avif?t=1754508226\" width=576 height=324 /></span><br><br><strong>Explore the wandering Mansion</strong><br><br>The crime takes place in a walking mansion, reminiscent of a giant mechanical octopus. You get to explore it's many nautical themed rooms via point and click mechanic. It pays to be thorough, as there are many secrets hiding in every corner. <br><br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785470/extras/ece4211fc599f42a40a7be6aa96f9863.avif?t=1754508226\" width=563 height=256 /></span><br><br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785470/extras/889f9b40e77b7be5289bb7be91e585d9.avif?t=1754508226\" width=576 height=324 /></span><br><br><strong>May the odds be in your favour!</strong><br><br>The &quot;Maritime Mecha Mystery&quot; adds a layer of excitement and challenge via occasional dice rolls to determine the outcome of decisions. This mechanic is  based on the simple and free &quot;Rookie's Die&quot; pen-and-paper tabletop RPG rule system.<br><br>You can tweak your odds a little by customizing Loki's stats before each playthrough. This way, no two adventures are the same.<br><br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785470/extras/2488b508854ddebff6e0170c752e6f4b.avif?t=1754508226\" width=576 height=324 /></span>",
